MEDICAL CORPS -- JINCHURIKI HEALTH RECORD (RESTRICTED)
Kazekage Office authorization required.

Subject: The host of the tailed beast. Historically Sunagakure's jinchuriki has
carried Shukaku, the One-Tail. This record notes the standing medical concerns
of the office.

Documented conditions of hosts:
- Chronic insomnia -- the One-Tail preyed on its hosts in sleep, threatening the
  seal. Prior hosts went years without true rest.
- Seal integrity -- monitored closely; emotional extremity and exhaustion
  weaken it. Any sign of involuntary sand-form manifestation is an emergency.
- Automatic sand defense -- the host is shielded by sand without conscious
  effort, complicating ordinary medical examination.

Note on Lord Gaara: Following the Akatsuki extraction of the One-Tail, the
Kazekage survived through the elder Chiyo's reviving sacrifice -- an outcome
without precedent in these records. Ongoing care attends to the aftereffects of
extraction. This file is held under the highest medical seal.
